# IINA evidence

A Jinja fixture is not Copier. Node VM is not JavaScriptCore. Browser WebKit is not
IINA's WKWebView. Not-run is never passed.

Report source checks, mock contracts, production bundle checks, and native IINA checks
as separate layers. `node scripts/doctor.mjs` is read-only metadata, not native proof.
